WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.740
I don't know how I'm gonna survive my mom's pageant season

00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:05.680
She already started her diet

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:06.580
Already?

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:10.080
Dumplin', the other side

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:10.980
[Moans]

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:12.800
Okay darlin', just grab my ankles

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:13.300
Uh-huh

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:13.880
Ok

00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:14.520
MmmHmm

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:16.080
Oh God

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.060
My name is Willadene Dixon

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:20.660
Hey, Willadene

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:21.920
Hi Bo

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.000
Most people call me Will

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:28.920
except for my mom, who calls me

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:30.480
Dumplin', I can't be late

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:32.580
This cannot exactly drive itself

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:36.090
Being a bit of a celebrity around here meant that she was too busy for me

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:38.280
You've got a hole in your left by the way

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:38.980
What?

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:46.540
[gasps] This must be your daughter

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:48.020
That's my daugher's best friend

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:50.160
This is my daughter Willadene

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:52.240
Wow, ok

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:54.740
And that's when I decided enough was enough

00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:55.880
I know that look

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:56.900
What's going on?

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:58.760
I think I'm gonna sign up for the pageant

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:02.120
It's gonna be like a protest in heels

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:04.040
Willadene Opal

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:06.980
Hey y'all, if you're signing up, I am too

00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:08.940
No, I'm not the Joan of Arc of fat girls

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:11.400
This is gonna be so much fun

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:12.600
Totally fun

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:14.680
Pageants are harder than you think

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:16.160
I'm Rosie Dixen's daughter

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:17.420
It runs in my blood

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:21.920
Woo!

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:23.520
We really have to play to our strengths

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:26.820
My strengths are hula hoop, and I can tap dance

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:29.820
[singing]

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:31.260
No no, um, stop it

00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:33.380
I think I know where we can get some help

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:34.440
What is this place?

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:36.840
It's the closest thing you can get to Dolly Parton around here

00:01:38.180 --> 00:01:39.160
Oh, wow

00:01:40.940 --> 00:01:43.740
Dumplin', I don't understand, why are you doing this?

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:45.000
It's a protest

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.580
We're trying to make a point

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:48.720
Willadene Dixon

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:50.480
I think you're beautiful

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:53.900
To Hell with anyone else who's ever made you feel less than that

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:57.220
There's nothing in the rules that says big girls need not apply

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:01.900
I've got myself into somethin'

00:02:01.940 --> 00:02:03.640
but now I don't know what I'm doin'

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:04.880
You know that Dolly saying?

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:07.340
Figure out who you are, and do it on purpose

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:13.320
Viva la revocion, baby!

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:16.200
That was truly a surprise

